* A small mining community in Skyrim is called [[Lore:Shor's Stone|Shor's Stone]].{{ref|name=TN2|{{Cite Book|The Nightingales Vol. 2}}}}
*[[Lore:Arnand the Fox|Arnand the Fox]] is a figure equated with the likes of Zurin Arctus and Pelinal,{{ref|name=WWYDB}} who was also known as Hans the Fox, which was the name of a literal fox said to be one of the [[Lore:Companions|Five Hundred Companions]].{{ref|group=UOL|{{Cite Book|The Five Hundred Mighty Companions or Thereabouts of Ysgramor the Returned|ns_base=General}}}}
